        hwTotalRemainingCapacityPercent OBJECT-TYPE
            SYNTAX Unsigned32 (0..100)
            MAX-ACCESS read-only
            STATUS current
            DESCRIPTION
                "Total Remaining Capacity Percent. 
                Value range: 0 to 100, unit: %, 
