        hwBattsTotalDischargeDepth OBJECT-TYPE
            SYNTAX Unsigned32 (0..100)
            MAX-ACCESS read-only
            STATUS current
            DESCRIPTION
                "Battery Total Discharge Depth Percent. Value range: 0 to 100, unit: %, and the value is an integer. If the value is 2147483647(0x7FFFFFFF), it indicates that the value is invalid."
            ::= { hwBattsOperate 11 }

        hwBatteryAddedCycleTimes OBJECT-TYPE
            SYNTAX Unsigned32 (0..3000000)
