            ::= { hwSiteBatteryCabinetEntry 5 }

        hwBatteryCabinetFan1Speed OBJECT-TYPE
            SYNTAX Integer32 (0..10000)
            MAX-ACCESS read-only
            STATUS current
            DESCRIPTION
