                unit: A. 
                and the value is accurate to one decimal place (.1).  
                If the value is 2147483647(0x7FFFFFFF), it indicates that the value is invalid."
            ::= { hwPowerControllerEquipSampEntry 42 }

        hwPowerControllerBatteryTemperature  OBJECT-TYPE
            SYNTAX Integer32 ( -400..1000)
            MAX-ACCESS read-only
            STATUS current
            DESCRIPTION
                "Battery temperature. It is a battery parameter collected in real time. 
                Value range: -40 to 100, 
                unit: centigrade (degC), 
                and the value is accurate to one decimal place (.1).  
                If the value is 2147483647(0x7FFFFFFF), it indicates that battery temperature is not configured."
            ::= { hwPowerControllerEquipSampEntry 43 }

