        hwIcbdGeneralBranchUsage OBJECT-TYPE
            SYNTAX INTEGER
                {
                leadAcidBattery(1),
                lithiumBattery(2),
                solarEnergy(3),
                dcGenset(4),
                powerCascadingPort(5),
                others(6),
                temperatureControl(7),
                windEnergy(8),
                otherGreenEnergy(9),
                tripartitePwParalConPrt(10)
                }
            MAX-ACCESS read-only
            STATUS current
            DESCRIPTION
                "State of the ICBD general branch usage.It is an enumeration type:
                If the enumeration value is 1, it indicates that branch usage is blvd Load,
                If the enumeration value is 2,it indicates that branch usage is customized load,
                If the enumeration value is 3, it indicates that branch usage is lead acid battery,
                If the enumeration value is 4, , it indicates that branch usage is lithium battery,
                If the enumeration value is 5, it indicates  that branch usage is solar energy,
                If the enumeration value is 6, it indicates  that branch usage is DC D.G.,
                If the enumeration value is 7, it indicates  that branch usage is power cascade,
                If the enumeration value is 8, it indicates  that branch usage is other,
                If the enumeration value is 9, it indicates  that branch usage is LLVD1 Load,
                If the enumeration value is 10, it indicates  that branch usage is LLVD2 Load,
                If the enumeration value is 11, it indicates  that branch usage is LLVD3 Load,
                If the enumeration value is 12, it indicates  that branch usage is LLVD4 Load,
                  If the enumeration value is 255, that battery operation status unknown."
