                {
                lockFunctionFullyClosed(1), lockFunctionFullyOpen(2), partialLockFunctionOpen(3)
                }
            MAX-ACCESS read-only
            STATUS current
            DESCRIPTION
                "PV Group Lock Enable State of the PV Adapter group. Only present on photovoltaic adapters, hybrid PV anti-theft requirements. It is an enumeration type: 
                  If the enumeration value is 1, it indicates that the LockFunctionFullyClosed;
                  If the enumeration value is 2, it indicates that the LockFunctionFullyOpen;
                  If the enumeration value is 3, it indicates that the PartialLockFunctionOpen."
